{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Merry Christmas!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいらりさゆりんみさみささゆにゃん中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりづらいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルの「今日」は25日\n本文の「今日」は24日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で読んで(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nクリスマスイヴと言っても\n何も変わらない1日を過ごしたわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\nもういつものブログにするね`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、変わったことあった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水曜日だし映画見たい！\n一人映画～♪\n『アオハライド』観たかったんだった！\n見よう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ったけど\n絶対これは周りを見て悲しい気持ちになるやつだ\nって気づいてやめました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人行動に何も抵抗ない中田が\n珍しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスには\n勝てなかった＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『アオハライド』いつ観れるの...(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前発売された\n「GiRLPOP 2015 WINTER」に載ってます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜が表紙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーと研究生で\n裏表紙やらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー、研究生にも\nチャンスを与えてくださるなんて\nありがたい(;_;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より、\n乃木坂めっちゃ載ってるってのが\nもうありがたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売された\n「street JACK」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャンの時期ぶりに載ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん表紙が目印！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全シングル制服着用collectionで\n中田は久々に\nおいシャンの時の制服を着ちゃってます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に見たいでしょ？`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも\n乃木坂たくさん載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスだし飯ぺろ～(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても\nクリスマスケーキではないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレート屋さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レダラッハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あさって26日に閉店してしまうんです(;_;)\n寂しい＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコの専門店にしては\n甘くて食べやすい感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと可愛い！\n今回買ったのにはみつばちいるけど\nネズミとかも売ってるよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/25/3834381/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントに喜ばれる系です(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閉店前に行ける機会があれば\n良かったら行ってみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/